Another way to think about it: if we have 12 students and 3 adults, that's 15 people. Each van can take 5. So, first van takes 5, second van takes next 5, third van takes the last 5. That's 3 vans. 

Yeah, that makes sense. So, 3 is the answer. I don't think there's any other way. So, the answer should be 3.

