Then the problem states that 4 puppies are adopted each day. The question is asking how long it will take for all of them to be adopted. So, we need to divide the total number of puppies by the number of puppies adopted per day. 

So, total puppies are 36, and 4 are adopted each day. So, 36 divided by 4. Let me calculate that. 36 divided by 4 is 9. So, it would take 9 days. 

