$$
\text{Total albums} = \text{Country albums} + \text{Pop albums} = 6 + 2 = 8
$$

**Step 2:** Calculate the total number of songs by multiplying the total number of albums by the number of songs per album.
$$
\text{Total songs} = \text{Total albums} \times \text{Songs per album} = 8 \times 9 = 72
$$

Thus, the total number of songs Janet bought is $\boxed{72}$. 

