Wait, but let me make sure I didn't miss anything. Is there any possibility that he can't buy a fraction of a toy? Like, if the division didn't come out even, would he have to round down? But in this case, it does come out even. 10 divided by 5 is exactly 2. So he can buy 2 toys without any problem. 

