   85 - 40 = 45
   $$
   So, she has **45 files remaining**.
3. **Determine the number of folders**: She put the remaining files into folders, with **5 files in each folder**.  
   $$
   45 \div 5 = 9
   $$
   Therefore, she created **9 folders**.

